{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x16---bart-vs-australia",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x16 - Bart vs Australia",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x16 - Bart vs. Australia.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:06.792Z",
  "lineCount": 272,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Bart vs. Australia",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 5000,
      "endMs": 10000
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Go, toothpaste. Go! Move your pasty, white butt!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 25017,
      "endMs": 27937
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Come on, shampoo! You can do it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 28105,
      "endMs": 30420
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "I won your stupid bathroom-products race!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 30588,
      "endMs": 33071
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "No fair. You only won because you had the inside track.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 33272,
      "endMs": 35856
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "If the water had spun the other way...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 36024,
      "endMs": 37702
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "It never spins the other way. In the Northern Hemisphere...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 37836,
      "endMs": 40454
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "...water always drains counter-clockwise.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 40621,
      "endMs": 42467
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "It's called the Coriolis effect.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 42635,
      "endMs": 44179
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "No way. Water doesn't obey your rules.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 44346,
      "endMs": 47501
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "It goes where it wants. Like me, babe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 47702,
      "endMs": 50185
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Yes, Bart. Why don't you try it and see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 50420,
      "endMs": 53910
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "I know I've seen it go the other way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 56528,
      "endMs": 59212
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Ah, faithful toilet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 59380,
      "endMs": 61729
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "You'll prove me right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 61897,
      "endMs": 63742
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "I'm singing in the show...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 70856,
      "endMs": 73944
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Hot! Cold!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 74078,
      "endMs": 76393
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Hot! Cold! Hot! Who's doing that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 76561,
      "endMs": 80487
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Oh, for Pete's sake, Bart, use the plunger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 83205,
      "endMs": 86997
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Bart, water will only go the other way in the Southern Hemisphere.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 87232,
      "endMs": 90454
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "What the hell is the Southern Hemisphere?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 90588,
      "endMs": 93272
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Haven't you ever looked at your globe?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 93407,
      "endMs": 95353
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "See? The Southern Hemisphere is made up of everything below the equa...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 97366,
      "endMs": 101427
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "This line.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 103407,
      "endMs": 105319
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "So down there in, say, Argentina...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 105789,
      "endMs": 109011
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "...or Rand McNally, all their water runs backwards?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 109179,
      "endMs": 112266
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "In fact, in Rand McNally, they wear hats on their feet...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113272,
      "endMs": 116762
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "...and hamburgers eat people. - Cool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 116930,
      "endMs": 120118
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Hello, Southern Hemisphere?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 138809,
      "endMs": 140085
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Which way does the water go in your toilet?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 140252,
      "endMs": 142299
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Just a minute, I'll check.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 142467,
      "endMs": 144917
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Nuts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 151158,
      "endMs": 152434
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Please to repeat again, and I will translating for the el presidente.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 156293,
      "endMs": 159850
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Which way does the water turn in your toilet?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 160051,
      "endMs": 162870
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "I can't get a straight answer out of this crazy hemisphere.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 172836,
      "endMs": 176226
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Nuisance phone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184078,
      "endMs": 185923
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Bart, you can't actually call these places.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192769,
      "endMs": 194917
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Don't you know how expensive international calls are?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 195085,
      "endMs": 199279
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Hello, operator, I'd like to make a collect call...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 199984,
      "endMs": 202870
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "...to Australia.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 203407,
      "endMs": 204682
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "This is the international operator. Will you accept a collect call from...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 211300,
      "endMs": 214689
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Yes, this is Dr. Bart Simpson of the International Drainage Commission.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 214857,
      "endMs": 218246
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "It's an emergency. If it's an emergency...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 218414,
      "endMs": 220528
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "We understand drains in your area have malfunctioned...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 220696,
      "endMs": 223213
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "...sucking in people and whatnot. - Willikers! That's awful!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 223381,
      "endMs": 226803
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Indeed. We need you to check your sinks and toilets...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 226971,
      "endMs": 229891
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "...and tell us which way the water is going. And please stand clear!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 230025,
      "endMs": 234555
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "The fixtures, they're all draining clockwise, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 240662,
      "endMs": 243683
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "She was right. Stupid Lisa, science queen.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 243850,
      "endMs": 246300
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Well, why don't you just check your neighbors' drains. I'll hold.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 246468,
      "endMs": 249958
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Hey, Bart, the bakery caught fire and all of downtown smells like cookies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 254354,
      "endMs": 258548
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Want to go smell?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258716,
      "endMs": 259991
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Yes. Yes, I do.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 260495,
      "endMs": 263347
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Hello, sir? Sir?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 270193,
      "endMs": 273112
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "I've returned from the Quilamaguery's place. They're draining clockwise too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273280,
      "endMs": 277240
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Draining? I don't care about that anymore.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 277407,
      "endMs": 279454
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Are we in any dang...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 279622,
      "endMs": 281032
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "\"Burkina Faso\"? \"Disputed Zone\"? Who called all these weird places?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 285998,
      "endMs": 290864
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Quiet, it might be you. I can 't remember.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 291032,
      "endMs": 292877
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "No, I'm gonna ask Marge. No! No! Why embarrass us both?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 293045,
      "endMs": 296401
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Just write a check and I'll release some more endorphins.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 296568,
      "endMs": 299488
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Nine hundred dollary-doos?! Tobias!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 302273,
      "endMs": 305730
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Did you accept a six-hour collect call from the States?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305897,
      "endMs": 309320
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "It was an emergency call...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 309521,
      "endMs": 310763
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "...from the International Drainage Commission in Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 310931,
      "endMs": 314152
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Oh, my God! There's nothing wrong with the bidet, is there?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 314354,
      "endMs": 317374
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Hello? Right, I'm calling all the way...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 318985,
      "endMs": 320964
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "...from Squatter's Crog, Australia.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 321132,
      "endMs": 322877
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "And I want to speak to Dr. Bart Simpson right now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 323045,
      "endMs": 327206
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Hold, please. All right, but I don't...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 327407,
      "endMs": 329454
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Hello. Burt Stanton speaking.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329622,
      "endMs": 331904
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "I said, Bart Simpson! What kind of company is this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 332072,
      "endMs": 334857
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Bart Simpson's office.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 335025,
      "endMs": 336300
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Thank the great, good Lord. Look, I was just saying...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 336468,
      "endMs": 338884
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "One moment, please.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 339052,
      "endMs": 340964
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Who do they think I am, some stupid Aussie drongo?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 341703,
      "endMs": 345428
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Bleeding Yanks. I ought to...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 345595,
      "endMs": 347139
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "This is Bart Simpson. Can I help you, ma'am?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 347307,
      "endMs": 350293
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Yeah... My name is Bruno Drundridge, right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 350428,
      "endMs": 352676
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "You owe me $900, mate!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 352844,
      "endMs": 354656
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "No, you owe me $900! All right, you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 354823,
      "endMs": 358213
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "You're just some punk kid, aren't you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 358951,
      "endMs": 361266
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "You picked the wrong guy to tangle with here, mate.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 361434,
      "endMs": 365629
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "I don't think so. You're all the way in Australia.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 365797,
      "endMs": 368951
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Hey, I think I hear a dingo eating your baby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 369119,
      "endMs": 372609
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "That's it! I'm gonna report this to me member of Parliament.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 374454,
      "endMs": 378079
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Hey, Gus!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 378280,
      "endMs": 379756
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "I got something to report to you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 379924,
      "endMs": 381938
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "That's a bloody outrage, it is!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 382139,
      "endMs": 384622
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "I'm gonna take this all the way to the prime minister!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 384790,
      "endMs": 388683
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Hey, Mr. Prime Minister!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 390495,
      "endMs": 394119
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Andy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 394320,
      "endMs": 395562
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Aye, mates. What's the good word?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 396233,
      "endMs": 398817
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "\"Mr. Simpson,\" blah, blah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 400528,
      "endMs": 402475
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "\"Misrepresentation over telephone...\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 402642,
      "endMs": 404824
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "\"Sincerely,\" some Australian jerk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404991,
      "endMs": 406837
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Hey, I need that!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 415830,
      "endMs": 418146
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "\"Office of the Solicitor General\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 418347,
      "endMs": 420193
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "\"Office of the Prime Minister\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 420360,
      "endMs": 422206
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "\"Hopping Mad Collection Agency\"? What is all this stuff?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 422407,
      "endMs": 426099
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Nothing. Some stupid country thinks I owe them money.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 426300,
      "endMs": 430293
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Bart, you better talk to Mom and Dad about this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 430461,
      "endMs": 433381
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Hey, guys? Just so you don't hear any wild rumors, I'm being indicted...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 433850,
      "endMs": 437374
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "...for fraud in Australia. - That's no reason to block the TV.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 437542,
      "endMs": 441099
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Oh, my.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 441300,
      "endMs": 442810
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Bart, did you trick an Australian boy into accepting a $900 collect call?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 444461,
      "endMs": 449092
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Yes'm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 449293,
      "endMs": 450669
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "There it is, Australia. I'll be damned.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 450870,
      "endMs": 456038
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Look at this country. \"You-are-gay.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 456340,
      "endMs": 459126
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Oh, my. Hello. I'm Evan Conover with the U.S. State Department.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 464394,
      "endMs": 468219
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "\"Undersecretary for International Protocol, Brat and Punk Division.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 468387,
      "endMs": 473991
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Unfortunately, your little escapade could not have come at a worse time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 474193,
      "endMs": 477615
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Americo-Australianian relations are at an all-time low.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 477817,
      "endMs": 481441
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "In the late 1980s, the U.S. Experienced a short-lived infatuation...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 483052,
      "endMs": 486676
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "...with Australian culture.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 488018,
      "endMs": 489327
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "The Aussies thought this would be permanent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 490938,
      "endMs": 492985
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "I know those words, but that sign makes no sense.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 494327,
      "endMs": 497112
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Anyway, the down-under fad fizzled, and the diplomatic climate...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 497280,
      "endMs": 500266
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "...turned absolutely frosty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 500434,
      "endMs": 502381
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "Let's pretend we didn't see that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 503991,
      "endMs": 506105
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "And Bart's childish taunting agitated the Aussies further.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 506978,
      "endMs": 510334
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Oh, he'll agitate you. He sure will.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 510568,
      "endMs": 514897
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "What can we do for you? It's too late...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 519428,
      "endMs": 521475
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "...to pay back the money.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 521642,
      "endMs": 522985
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "But as a sign of good faith to our Australian friends...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 523152,
      "endMs": 525736
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "...we'd like to imprison Bart for five years.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 525904,
      "endMs": 528052
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "That's tough but fair. Boy, go with the man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 528488,
      "endMs": 531139
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "No, no, no!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 531307,
      "endMs": 533857
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "I'm not gonna have my son go to jail over some silly tiff with Australia.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 534058,
      "endMs": 538320
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "You'll just have to find some other country to have relations with.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538555,
      "endMs": 542313
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "You're sure, now? The prison train is sailing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 542515,
      "endMs": 545334
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Okay, I'm not hearing a lot of support for prison.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 545535,
      "endMs": 548488
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "There is one other option.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 548656,
      "endMs": 550535
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "They'll drop the charges if Bart makes a public apology in Australia.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 550703,
      "endMs": 554897
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "All Bart has to do is apologize and we get a free trip to Australia?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 555099,
      "endMs": 558219
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "I can handle that. I'm an expert at phony apologies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559360,
      "endMs": 561777
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Bart! I'm sorry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 561944,
      "endMs": 563354
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "That's better.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 563521,
      "endMs": 565266
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "We left at 1:30 p.m., Monday. What time is it now?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 597280,
      "endMs": 600266
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "It's 6:45 a.m., next Wednesday.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 600468,
      "endMs": 602515
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "You may also be interested to know that it's summer here, not winter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 602683,
      "endMs": 605904
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "What does that sign say? I thought they spoke English in this country.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 607850,
      "endMs": 611105
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "It says you can't bring in outside plants or animals.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 611273,
      "endMs": 614327
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Any foreign creature you bring in could upset the environmental balance.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 614528,
      "endMs": 619562
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Sorry, girl, I don't want to get in any more trouble down here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 621172,
      "endMs": 624662
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "I'll pick you up on the way home.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 624998,
      "endMs": 627649
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Hey, are you, like, one of those English guards...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 643723,
      "endMs": 646240
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "...who can't laugh or smile or anything?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 646407,
      "endMs": 649092
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "No, sir! U.S. Marine Corps, sir!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654126,
      "endMs": 656407
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Oh, yeah. This is the life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 659193,
      "endMs": 661709
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Boy, next summer can you commit some fraud in Orlando, Florida?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 661911,
      "endMs": 665300
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "I'm way ahead of you, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 665468,
      "endMs": 667246
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Knock. Simpsons, I'd like you to meet our ambassador...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 667414,
      "endMs": 670501
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "...the Honorable Averil Ward.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 670669,
      "endMs": 672280
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Hello. Now, everything is all set for Bart's apology.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 672481,
      "endMs": 675803
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Mr. Conover will meet you at the Parliament House at 3 p.m.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 676005,
      "endMs": 678756
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Any questions?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 678924,
      "endMs": 680166
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Do the toilets go backwards in here? No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 680334,
      "endMs": 682481
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "To combat homesickness, we have a device that makes...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 682716,
      "endMs": 685233
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "...them swirl the correct American way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 685434,
      "endMs": 687246
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Sweet land of liberty Of thee I sing",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 693018,
      "endMs": 699763
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Hey, GI Joe, your sign's broken. We're already in Australia.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 703488,
      "endMs": 707179
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Actually, sir, the embassy is considered American soil, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 707381,
      "endMs": 710334
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Really? Look, boy. Now I'm in Australia.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 710535,
      "endMs": 713454
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Now I'm in America. Australia. America.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 713622,
      "endMs": 716105
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Australia. I get it, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 716273,
      "endMs": 718119
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Homer, that's enough.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 718287,
      "endMs": 720703
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Here in America, we don't tolerate that crap, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 721676,
      "endMs": 724226
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "\"Australia was founded as a settlement for British convicts.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 728152,
      "endMs": 731407
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Lisa, watch your camera.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 731575,
      "endMs": 733354
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "You call that a knife?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 740099,
      "endMs": 741307
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "This is a knife.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 742146,
      "endMs": 743891
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "That's not a knife. That's a spoon. All right, all right. You win.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 744058,
      "endMs": 747716
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "I see you've played knifie-spoonie before.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 748454,
      "endMs": 750770
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Hey, give me one of those famous giant beers I've heard so much about.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 752683,
      "endMs": 757515
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Something wrong, Yank?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 757683,
      "endMs": 759092
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "No. It's pretty big, I guess.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 759260,
      "endMs": 762381
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "I'll just have a cup of coffee. Beer it is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 762783,
      "endMs": 765602
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "No, I said, coffee.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 765770,
      "endMs": 767280
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Beer? Coffee.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 767414,
      "endMs": 770233
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Beer?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 770401,
      "endMs": 771944
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "C-O... B-E...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 772112,
      "endMs": 776038
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "We'll meet you boys back here for dinner. Good luck, honey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 781441,
      "endMs": 784193
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Bart, I'm sorry I'm gonna miss your public humiliation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 785636,
      "endMs": 788219
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "But the Walambaloo Dirt Monument is just too exciting to pass up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 788354,
      "endMs": 792515
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Hear ye! Hear ye! This session will now come to order.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 800593,
      "endMs": 804519
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "With the cooperation of the U.S. Department of State...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 804854,
      "endMs": 807405
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "...we have present today one Bart Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 807573,
      "endMs": 809619
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "I believe he has something to say.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 812774,
      "endMs": 814989
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Bart?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 815190,
      "endMs": 816834
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "I'm sorry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 824519,
      "endMs": 825995
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "I'm sorry for what I did to your country.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 826163,
      "endMs": 829217
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Well, you're free to go, Bart...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 830794,
      "endMs": 834015
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "...right after your additional punishment.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 834183,
      "endMs": 835660
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Punishment! A mere apology would be a bit empty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 837774,
      "endMs": 840458
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Let the booting begin!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 840626,
      "endMs": 842472
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Booting? It's just a little kick in the bum.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 842673,
      "endMs": 845324
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "What kind of a sick country would kick someone with a giant boot?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 857516,
      "endMs": 860670
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Mr. Simpson, shush. Disparaging the boot is a bootable offense.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 860804,
      "endMs": 864227
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "It's one of their proudest traditions.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 864395,
      "endMs": 866643
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "You sold us out, Conover!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 871744,
      "endMs": 874563
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Stand back or I'll boot your prime minister! I'll do it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 883053,
      "endMs": 885972
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "So help me God, I'll boot him!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 886140,
      "endMs": 888623
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "When will you Australians learn?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 889865,
      "endMs": 891442
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "In America, we stopped using corporal punishment.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 891610,
      "endMs": 894294
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "And things have never been better. The streets are safe...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 894429,
      "endMs": 897147
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "...old people strut confidently through the darkest alleys...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 897314,
      "endMs": 900402
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "...and the weak and nerdy are admired for their computer-programming abilities.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 900569,
      "endMs": 904697
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "So like us, let your children run wild and free...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 904865,
      "endMs": 908791
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "...because, as the old saying goes: \"Let your children run wild and free.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908925,
      "endMs": 915167
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Now, boy, run back to the embassy! Back to American soil!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 915368,
      "endMs": 920536
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "I'll stop them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 923623,
      "endMs": 925637
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Oh, no, it's coming back this way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 928355,
      "endMs": 930637
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "That throwing stick stunt of yours has boomeranged on us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 930804,
      "endMs": 934127
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Hey, we can get away in their pouches.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 937818,
      "endMs": 940267
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "It's not like in cartoons.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 942751,
      "endMs": 944596
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Yeah. There's a lot more mucus.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944764,
      "endMs": 947247
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Mom, you said I could have one souvenir, right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 951878,
      "endMs": 954059
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Well, I want a didjeridu.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 954227,
      "endMs": 955469
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "That seems very noisy and expensive for a souvenir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 960737,
      "endMs": 964831
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Why don't you get this nice cap. It's clever, just like you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 965033,
      "endMs": 968724
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Get out! Get out! Shoo! Shoo! Get out of here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 971744,
      "endMs": 976811
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "These bloody things are everywhere. They're in the lift, the lorry...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 977046,
      "endMs": 980402
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "...in the bon whizzer, and the Malonga Gilderchuck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980569,
      "endMs": 983053
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "They're like kangaroos. But they're reptiles, they is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 983288,
      "endMs": 987180
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "We have them in America. They're called bullfrogs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 987382,
      "endMs": 989764
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "What? That's an odd name.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 989965,
      "endMs": 991878
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "I'd have called them chazwazzers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 992046,
      "endMs": 994261
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "Lisa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 996308,
      "endMs": 998623
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Marge!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 998825,
      "endMs": 1000569
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "The Simpsons.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1009328,
      "endMs": 1010603
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Well, they're not getting back in here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1010771,
      "endMs": 1013153
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "I can't believe our government would set up Bart like that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1027946,
      "endMs": 1030698
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "I'm very angry at the State Department right now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1030832,
      "endMs": 1033584
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Yes, but... Please, we're about to reach a breakthrough with the Aussies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1033751,
      "endMs": 1037476
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Then it's agreed. During the bargaining session, we each get two candy apples.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1037644,
      "endMs": 1041268
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "All right, one candy and one caramel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1041436,
      "endMs": 1043516
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Oh, for the love of criminy! Give me that!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1043718,
      "endMs": 1045698
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "I know Bart did something wrong. But he's my son...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1045865,
      "endMs": 1048483
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "...and I'm going to punish him myself.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1048651,
      "endMs": 1051100
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Our countries may have their differences...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1051302,
      "endMs": 1053416
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "...but as human beings, I think we can all agree...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1053584,
      "endMs": 1056704
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "...there's no substitute for the discipline of a loving parent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1056872,
      "endMs": 1061570
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "He wants to talk to you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1062342,
      "endMs": 1064053
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Hello.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1064255,
      "endMs": 1066100
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "So we're in agreement.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1066436,
      "endMs": 1067678
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "She won't be allowed near the phone again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1067845,
      "endMs": 1070027
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "We did it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1071201,
      "endMs": 1072443
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "We've worked out a compromise that will allow both nations to save face.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1072644,
      "endMs": 1076100
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "We've argued them down to...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1076302,
      "endMs": 1077745
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "...a booting. - What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1077912,
      "endMs": 1079154
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "The prime minister just wants to kick you once through the gate...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1079355,
      "endMs": 1082812
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "...with a regular shoe. - I believe it's a wingtip.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1082980,
      "endMs": 1085664
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "No deal. This is my son we're talking about.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1085798,
      "endMs": 1088751
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "Sure, he's not perfect, but who is in this workaday world?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1088919,
      "endMs": 1092006
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "No. Mom, wait.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1092208,
      "endMs": 1094423
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "It's time for me to bend over and receive my destiny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1101570,
      "endMs": 1105631
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Thank you, Bart. I promise I won't make fun of you later for this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1110228,
      "endMs": 1114859
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Show them what American butts are made of, son.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1115060,
      "endMs": 1117946
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "That's it, lad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1122376,
      "endMs": 1123718
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "This is for the Commonwealth of Australia.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1124053,
      "endMs": 1127074
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "And this is for the United States of America.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1133886,
      "endMs": 1136067
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "I'm glad you're okay, honey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1152946,
      "endMs": 1154288
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "But I wish you'd chosen a more tasteful way to be patriotic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1154456,
      "endMs": 1157208
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "I'm impressed you were able to write so legibly on your own butt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1157376,
      "endMs": 1160731
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "All right, mates, let them have it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1171906,
      "endMs": 1174758
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Hey, do we get to land on an aircraft carrier?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1178315,
      "endMs": 1180429
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "No, sir. The closest vessel is the USS Walter Mondale.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1180597,
      "endMs": 1183818
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "It's a laundry ship. They'll take you the rest of the way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1183986,
      "endMs": 1186805
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Hey, look. Those frogs are eating all their crops.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1199725,
      "endMs": 1203684
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Well, that's what happens when you introduce foreign species...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1208584,
      "endMs": 1211503
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "...into an ecosystem that can't handle them. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1211637,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 6,
    "episode": 16
  }
}
